---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Visual from '../components/Visual.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import GalleryGrid from '../components/GalleryGrid.astro';
import { posts, gallery, sectionOf, href } from '../lib/blog';
import { theme, sections } from '../theme';
const entries=await posts();const works=await gallery();
const thoughts=entries.filter(p=>sectionOf(p)==='thoughts');const tech=entries.filter(p=>sectionOf(p)==='tech');
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> 观物有思 · 落笔成序</p><h1>思考，创造，<br/>然后<span class="serif accent">记录。</span></h1><p class="hero-description">{theme.tagline}<br/>{theme.description}</p><a class="text-link" href="#explore">从这里开始 <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-art"><Visual/><div class="art-caption"><span>HEMIN / JOURNAL</span><span>一种观察世界的方式</span></div></div></section>
<div class="section-navigation" id="explore">{Object.entries(sections).map(([key,s])=><a href={href(`${key}.html`)}><span class="section-number">{s.number} /</span><span class="section-nav-title">{s.title}<small>{s.english}</small></span><span>↗</span></a>)}</div>
<section class="home-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THOUGHTS & NOTES</p><h2>写给自己的旁白<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={href('thoughts.html')}>全部思考 ↗</a></div>{thoughts.length?<PostList entries={thoughts.slice(0,3)}/>:<p class="empty-note">新的思考，正在酝酿中。</p>}</section>
<section class="gallery-band"><div class="gallery-intro"><p class="eyebrow">贰 / THE VIEWING ROOM</p><h2>让目光<br/>停留片刻<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p>于光影之间驻足，<br/>在作品面前，慢一点观看。</p><a class="text-link" href={href('gallery.html')}>进入展厅 ↗</a></div>{works.length?<GalleryGrid entries={works.slice(0,2)}/>:<div class="gallery-pending"><Visual small/><p class="eyebrow">画廊筹备中 · 期待第一件作品</p></div>}</section>
<section class="home-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / CODE & PRACTICE</p><h2>把探索留成路径<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={href('tech.html')}>全部技术 ↗</a></div><PostList entries={tech.slice(0,3)}/></section>
<section class="closing-note"><span class="eyebrow">A NOTE TO SELF</span><p>保持对世界的感受力，<br/>也保持把事情做好的耐心。</p><a class="text-link" href={href('about.html')}>关于我 ↗</a></section></Layout>
